  "findings": [
    "In these traced runs desktop initialization finished more than 1.3 seconds before selection, so unfinished startup did not overlap the selection.",
    "Notification dispatch and offer restoration were sub-millisecond on the two message-driven traces. The third offer was restored before its explicit capture notification was dispatched; late modal-loop dispatch must not be misread as pre-dialog latency.",
    "Control creation/population and synchronous paint are measurable post-restoration costs. The previously seen 871 ms outlier was not reproduced by these traces.",
    "The frame-setup startup interval includes applyStartupGlobalLimiter and MainWindow construction, and is separate from warm File Info timing."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Only three trace-enabled and two observations each for disabled/original paths; descriptive observations, no stable distribution, causal overhead estimate or IDM parity.",
    "Trace event copy work is measured, but index reservation, final commit, memory-mapping startup and all scheduling effects are not fully included in that overhead number.",
    "No CPU accounting, heap allocation or explicit disk flush occurs per event. Mapping creation/first-touch happens before the app-init-entry marker.",
    "Absolute FILETIME alignment is coarse; QPC deltas are authoritative for stage intervals. The external observer polls controls and may detect readiness after native paint.",
    "These selected-video runs start after diagnostics readiness and do not measure full cold browser-click-to-process startup.",
    "The diagnostic executable uses the actual Application path and a compile-time tracing flag; the original production executables remain byte-identical.",
    "Private Edge profiles and private catalogs; no installed/personal-browser or fresh IDM acceptance. Installed UDM remains 7.11."
  ],
  "next": "Measure true cold capture startup, then investigate the measured frame-setup cost and control creation/painting. Preserve UI ownership and reveal behavior before considering deferred hidden main-window visual initialization. Do not optimize COM registration or posted capture dispatch based on the older hypotheses.",
